WEBVTT

00:00:05.606 --> 00:00:08.025
It wasn’t Yatterman…

00:00:08.025 --> 00:00:10.111
It was Dokurobey…

00:00:10.111 --> 00:00:13.239
For his stupid revenge…

00:00:13.239 --> 00:00:17.702
…he made many people suffer. He hurt them.

00:00:17.702 --> 00:00:22.498
He did things that made them sad.
I’ll never forgive him.

00:00:22.498 --> 00:00:25.918
There’s no place to escape to in Yatter Kingdom.

00:00:25.918 --> 00:00:27.962
We can’t run.

00:00:27.962 --> 00:00:29.672
We’ll fight!

00:00:29.672 --> 00:00:32.175
Yeah, let’s bring him down.

00:00:32.175 --> 00:00:33.843
Let’s do it.

00:00:33.843 --> 00:00:35.553
Let’s do it!

00:00:35.553 --> 00:00:36.846
But…

00:00:36.846 --> 00:00:38.222
Gatchan?

00:00:38.222 --> 00:00:41.475
We can’t do anything by ourselves.

00:00:41.475 --> 00:00:44.020
He’s got all those Yatter soldiers,
the Twelve Yatter Guardian Gods

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:46.105
and Yatter mechas…

00:00:46.105 --> 00:00:49.025
"What is important is invisible to the eyes".

00:00:50.193 --> 00:00:52.278
It’s a quote from an old book.

00:00:52.278 --> 00:00:57.575
For Yatter Metropolis…
No, for everyone who lives in Yatter Kingdom…

00:00:57.575 --> 00:01:01.245
…what’s important is everyone’s heart-s.

00:01:01.245 --> 00:01:02.914
They think that it is all for Yatterman,

00:01:02.914 --> 00:01:06.500
so they look away from
their own sadness and suffering.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.711
Unless that changes…

00:01:08.711 --> 00:01:13.507
Unless people rise up
to bring light to this darkness,

00:01:13.507 --> 00:01:16.344
nothing will change.

00:01:16.344 --> 00:01:20.681
That power from everyone will
become the power to defeat Dokurobey!

00:01:20.681 --> 00:01:22.016
Let’s tell them!

00:01:22.016 --> 00:01:23.226
Tell them?

00:01:23.226 --> 00:01:28.314
The truth! They’re suffering
all because of Dokurobey!

00:01:28.314 --> 00:01:30.942
Let’s open their eyes!

00:01:30.942 --> 00:01:33.236
Let’s help them rise up!

00:01:33.236 --> 00:01:36.072
Guys! Are you ready?!

00:01:36.072 --> 00:01:41.035
his fingers to the bone every day--
--But even if you guys went there…

00:01:41.035 --> 00:01:43.996
Everyone! Listen to me!

00:01:43.996 --> 00:01:47.250
The one who’s making you suffer isn’t Yatterman!

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:50.086
It’s Dokurobey!

00:01:50.086 --> 00:01:51.754
Please listen!

00:01:51.754 --> 00:01:54.674
If you listen to us, we’ll give you a pig!

00:01:54.674 --> 00:01:58.427
In this place, people won’t listen to them!

00:01:58.427 --> 00:02:00.763
Traitorous Doronbow!

00:02:00.763 --> 00:02:05.101
Lord Yatterman is Dokurobey?!
You shouldn’t lie like that!

00:02:05.101 --> 00:02:08.271
You need to be punished after all!

00:02:09.021 --> 00:02:09.939
Oh, shoot!

00:02:09.939 --> 00:02:11.023
Miss Doronjo!

00:02:11.023 --> 00:02:13.776
Don’t be in our way!

00:02:13.776 --> 00:02:15.152
Don’t let them get away!

00:02:15.152 --> 00:02:17.488
Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter!

00:02:17.488 --> 00:02:18.322
Yatter! Yatter…!

00:02:18.322 --> 00:02:20.491
This is a world of darkness!

00:02:20.491 --> 00:02:24.787
Why?! It’s because of Dokurobey!

00:02:24.787 --> 00:02:28.499
There’s no Yatterman here!

00:02:28.499 --> 00:02:30.084
Doronjo!

00:02:30.084 --> 00:02:31.752
Capture them!

00:02:31.752 --> 00:02:33.796
Quit following us!

00:02:33.796 --> 00:02:35.631
What should we do?

00:02:35.631 --> 00:02:36.841
Ally, this way.

00:02:36.841 --> 00:02:40.678
What can we do…
to bring them all to their senses?

00:02:44.056 --> 00:02:47.310
Looks like we were able to escape.

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.228
We can relax a little now.

00:02:49.228 --> 00:02:52.523
Why aren’t they listening to us?!

00:02:52.523 --> 00:02:54.525
Is it because I'm Doronjo?!

00:02:54.525 --> 00:02:56.944
Because we’re descendants of Doronbow?!

00:02:56.944 --> 00:02:58.696
Well, people have portrayed us

00:02:58.696 --> 00:03:01.449
as villains from generation to generation, so…

00:03:01.449 --> 00:03:05.828
Then… who would they listen to?

00:03:10.333 --> 00:03:13.961
As we traveled away from
our hometown, I've come to realize

00:03:13.961 --> 00:03:17.465
that someone has to change the world.

00:03:17.465 --> 00:03:20.885
We’re the only ones who can do it now.

00:03:20.885 --> 00:03:23.804
Ally, you know, don’t you?

00:03:23.804 --> 00:03:29.477
You know that you can’t keep
turning a blind eye on things, right?

00:03:29.477 --> 00:03:34.190
That there are times when you need
to see it even if you don’t want to…

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:38.736
We can’t have Doronjo and the guys do it…

00:03:38.736 --> 00:03:42.740
…because they’re descendants
of the proud Doronbow.

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:48.120
We’ll have to do it.
Ally, let us become Yatterman!

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:52.041
People would listen to Yatterman.

00:03:52.041 --> 00:03:55.378
I’ll be Gan, Yatterman 1.

00:03:55.378 --> 00:03:59.215
Ally, you’ll be Ai, Yatterman 2.

00:03:59.215 --> 00:04:01.634
What’s important is the symbol.

00:04:01.634 --> 00:04:05.721
Ally… We can’t keep running forever.

00:04:05.721 --> 00:04:10.142
Your mom, dad, and dog are dead.

00:04:12.228 --> 00:04:17.566
Let’s make it so that no one
has to suffer the way you have.

00:04:17.566 --> 00:04:24.281
Let’s tell them that even if there are
sad things, there’ll be good things, too…

00:04:24.281 --> 00:04:28.494
…just like Doronjo told us.

00:04:28.494 --> 00:04:33.040
Your name, Alouette, means "skylark",
a bird that announces the arrival of spring.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:38.754
My name, Galina, means "hen",
a bird that announces the arrival of morning.

00:04:38.754 --> 00:04:45.010
I promised Mr. Gorozo
that I’d protect you at any cost.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:48.597
We’ll open their eyes.

00:04:48.597 --> 00:04:55.438
We’ll bring hope to their hearts.
We’ll bring light… to their dreams.

00:04:55.438 --> 00:04:57.148
Yes.

00:04:57.148 --> 00:04:58.816
Thank you.

00:05:13.622 --> 00:05:16.333
What’re you gonna use that for, oink?

00:05:17.626 --> 00:05:19.712
Listen, Alouette.

00:05:19.712 --> 00:05:24.216
From what I read in the picture book…
and from what I heard from my mom,

00:05:24.216 --> 00:05:28.095
I've always thought that Yatterman was a hero.

00:05:28.095 --> 00:05:32.516
I thought that Yatter Kingdom
was a place like heaven.

00:05:32.516 --> 00:05:40.566
If you and Gatchan play the role of
Yatterman, it’ll make me… happy.

00:05:40.566 --> 00:05:45.196
I'm sure that Yatter Kingdom
will become a heavenly place.

00:05:45.196 --> 00:05:46.947
Doronjo…

00:05:55.581 --> 00:05:57.666
Doronjo?

00:05:59.168 --> 00:06:02.630
That’s… right.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:05.466
Thank you for everything.

00:06:05.466 --> 00:06:07.551
My angel…

00:06:09.261 --> 00:06:12.723
Alouette… let’s make a promise.

00:06:12.723 --> 00:06:14.892
A promise?

00:06:14.892 --> 00:06:16.977
Yeah.

00:06:16.977 --> 00:06:18.646
For those who’re hanging their heads

00:06:18.646 --> 00:06:21.857
to be able to move forward
with their heads held high…

00:06:21.857 --> 00:06:30.157
We’ll bring a new dawn like that.

00:06:30.157 --> 00:06:32.201
When everything is over,

00:06:32.201 --> 00:06:36.080
I want to go on a trip to find
high-school-girls around the country.

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:39.667
That sounds good.
Maybe I’ll go find pigs around the--

00:06:39.667 --> 00:06:41.043
But…

00:06:41.043 --> 00:06:44.964
…that’ll have to wait until our precious angel…

00:06:44.964 --> 00:06:47.049
…our angel of hope…

00:06:47.049 --> 00:06:50.094
…no longer needs our protection.

00:06:50.094 --> 00:06:51.845
Yeah…

00:06:56.225 --> 00:06:58.978
Done!

00:06:58.978 --> 00:07:00.479
You’re finished?

00:07:00.479 --> 00:07:01.897
Yep!

00:07:01.897 --> 00:07:05.234
That’s our Gatchan! You’re good at it!

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:08.737
Doronjo…

00:07:08.737 --> 00:07:09.822
Take that off.

00:07:09.822 --> 00:07:11.782
What?!

00:07:11.782 --> 00:07:14.702
It’s torn, so I’ll mend it for you.

00:07:17.288 --> 00:07:19.206
Thanks.

00:07:19.206 --> 00:07:20.416
Gatchan.

00:07:20.416 --> 00:07:21.166
Hm?

00:07:21.166 --> 00:07:23.669
Thanks for everything.

00:07:23.669 --> 00:07:26.755
I'm the one who wants to say thanks.

00:07:26.755 --> 00:07:29.216
I'm glad that I met you.

00:07:29.216 --> 00:07:31.385
Yeah.

00:07:31.385 --> 00:07:32.511
It’s done.

00:07:32.511 --> 00:07:34.388
Thank you!

00:07:35.973 --> 00:07:39.476
Thanks to Mr. Boyacky,
I’ve learned a lot about machines.

00:07:39.476 --> 00:07:44.940
Thanks to Mr. Tonzra,
I've become a bit tougher, I think.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:47.776
I feel like I've become
mentally strong, as well.

00:07:47.776 --> 00:07:50.029
It’s all thanks to you, Doronjo.

00:07:56.368 --> 00:07:59.038
Yep, it looks good on you.

00:08:04.126 --> 00:08:05.169
Well then…

00:08:05.169 --> 00:08:07.630
Let’s do it!

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:10.841
Yeah!

00:08:17.097 --> 00:08:19.725
Are you sure this is really okay?

00:08:19.725 --> 00:08:23.646
Gatchan and Alouette will
become Yatterman. lt means--

00:08:23.646 --> 00:08:29.318
I know… that this is our first
and last time working together.

00:08:29.318 --> 00:08:33.447
Once we defeat Dokurobey,
we won’t be able to see them again.

00:08:33.447 --> 00:08:36.825
Yatterman and Doronbow are enemies.

00:08:36.825 --> 00:08:43.540
If they’re with us, even if they
defeat Dokurobey, no one will trust them.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:49.004
W-We need Yatterman to stay a hero.

00:08:49.004 --> 00:08:53.384
Good-bye, adios… Sayonara, adios…

00:08:53.384 --> 00:08:57.137
A-A cool woman won’t look back.

00:08:57.137 --> 00:09:02.893
Now, smile! Remember? You promised
your mom that you’d never stop smiling!

00:09:02.893 --> 00:09:05.187
See?!

00:09:05.187 --> 00:09:09.358
A cool woman won’t look back.

00:09:09.358 --> 00:09:12.736
G-Gatchan!

00:09:12.736 --> 00:09:14.113
Doronjo?

00:09:14.113 --> 00:09:22.204
U-Uhm… l’ll… always…

00:09:22.204 --> 00:09:26.208
…be waiti--

00:09:26.208 --> 00:09:29.628
Gatchan! Good luck!

00:09:33.132 --> 00:09:36.135
Yes, ma’am!

00:09:38.762 --> 00:09:44.977
Good-bye.

00:09:48.698 --> 00:09:54.245
You’re done for the day.
You’re done for the day.

00:09:54.245 --> 00:09:58.165
Appreciate Great Lord Yatterman
for giving you work.

00:09:58.165 --> 00:09:59.750
Yatterman!

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:04.672
Yatter… Yatter… Yatter…

00:10:27.194 --> 00:10:30.740
Everyone!

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:43.335
--Yatter!
--Yatter!

00:10:48.299 --> 00:10:51.260
Listen, everyone!

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:55.306
I'm sorry for allowing
you to suffer all this time.

00:10:55.306 --> 00:10:57.141
I'm really sorry!

00:10:57.141 --> 00:11:00.436
I won’t make you suffer any longer!

00:11:00.436 --> 00:11:05.024
This world is enveloped in
darkness right now! It’s pitch dark!

00:11:05.024 --> 00:11:08.569
But the dawn is just around the corner!

00:11:08.569 --> 00:11:11.280
I want you to help us!

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:15.576
The one who is controlling
this world right now is Dokurobey!

00:11:15.576 --> 00:11:19.580
We weren’t here. Just think about it.

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:24.251
Do you think that the real
Yatterman would make you suffer?

00:11:24.251 --> 00:11:26.962
Do you think that they would
do things to make you sad?

00:11:26.962 --> 00:11:29.882
I'm really sorry that we
haven’t been around for so long!

00:11:29.882 --> 00:11:33.803
But we came back! To release you!

00:11:33.803 --> 00:11:36.222
To defeat Dokurobey!

00:11:37.807 --> 00:11:39.520
Yatterman 1!

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:42.520
Yatterman 2!

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:44.980
Please help us!

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:47.817
Let’s defeat Dokurobey together!

00:11:47.817 --> 00:11:50.152
The darkest hour is always just before the dawn!

00:11:50.152 --> 00:11:53.489
Let’s bring an end to this pitch-dark world!

00:11:53.489 --> 00:11:58.994
The darkest hour is always just before the dawn!

00:11:58.994 --> 00:12:00.746
We’ll defeat Dokurobey,

00:12:00.746 --> 00:12:03.749
and bring a new dawn to this world!

00:12:03.749 --> 00:12:08.754
As long as Yatterman exists,
evil will have no place in this world!

00:12:08.754 --> 00:12:12.758
Yatter! Yatter! Yatterman!

00:12:12.758 --> 00:12:15.636
Yatterman!

00:12:15.636 --> 00:12:23.018
Yatter! Yatter! Yatterman!
Yatter! Yatter! Yatterman!

00:12:23.018 --> 00:12:27.022
--Yatter! Yatter! Yatterman!
--Y.. Yatter…

00:12:27.022 --> 00:12:30.401
Yatter… Yatter… Yatterman…!

00:12:30.401 --> 00:12:37.908
--Yatter! Yatter! Yatterman!
--Yatter! Yatter! Yatterman!

00:12:37.908 --> 00:12:39.535
Yatter! Yatter! Yatterman!

00:12:39.535 --> 00:12:41.495
What do you think you’re doing?!

00:12:41.495 --> 00:12:43.789
I won’t let you… interfere!

00:12:50.713 --> 00:12:53.465
We are the great Doronbow!

00:12:53.465 --> 00:12:55.551
Let’s go, guys!

00:12:55.551 --> 00:12:57.386
Give them hell!

00:12:57.386 --> 00:13:00.222
Yes, ma’am!

00:13:02.683 --> 00:13:10.065
Even a pig will climb a
tree when flattered. Oink!

00:13:21.368 --> 00:13:24.204
I'm counting on you… Dog!

00:13:39.053 --> 00:13:40.930
Le’s go, Ai!

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:43.098
Yep, Gan!

00:13:46.143 --> 00:13:47.519
Yatterman!

00:13:47.519 --> 00:13:49.021
Move out!

00:14:05.955 --> 00:14:08.374
Electric Stick!

00:14:23.889 --> 00:14:28.102
How dare they call themselves
Lord and Lady Yatterman!

00:14:37.528 --> 00:14:42.366
Watching you, I'm past being angry.
lt just makes me laugh!

00:14:49.581 --> 00:14:51.667
What’re you trying to accomplish?

00:15:01.552 --> 00:15:04.513
Ball-and-Cup Magic!

00:15:55.105 --> 00:16:02.154
I won’t let any of you leave here alive!

00:16:02.154 --> 00:16:07.659
It’s punishment time!

00:16:18.003 --> 00:16:21.090
Take… this!

00:16:30.599 --> 00:16:32.392
And this!

00:16:47.616 --> 00:16:49.451
They’re persistent!

00:16:49.451 --> 00:16:52.746
Miss Doronjo. This Kitchen-N-Roll
is about to run out of fuel

00:16:52.746 --> 00:16:54.081
We’re gonna charge in!

00:16:54.081 --> 00:16:55.499
What?!

00:16:55.499 --> 00:16:57.376
Miss Doronjo?!

00:16:57.376 --> 00:17:01.630
Charge!

00:17:18.105 --> 00:17:20.482
Seriously, you’re so reckless!

00:17:20.482 --> 00:17:22.860
Boyacky! Are you okay?

00:17:22.860 --> 00:17:24.361
Yes, ma’am.

00:17:27.489 --> 00:17:30.576
When our comrades are a burden,

00:17:30.576 --> 00:17:35.038
that makes more work
for us, doesn’t it, Tonzra?

00:17:35.038 --> 00:17:38.709
Don’t lump us together!

00:18:06.361 --> 00:18:08.280
Doggie!

00:20:07.441 --> 00:20:08.483
Give them hell!

00:20:08.483 --> 00:20:10.235
<i>And click.</i>

00:20:37.429 --> 00:20:39.765
Take this!

00:21:36.655 --> 00:21:43.245
Ugh!

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:36.707
Say, Honorable Oda…
My ancestors passed down this song

00:22:36.707 --> 00:22:41.587
to their children from
generation to generation…

00:22:41.587 --> 00:22:46.592
It must mean that my ancestor
also felt that Yatterman was--

00:22:46.592 --> 00:22:49.428
Ai, let’s get going.

00:23:12.409 --> 00:23:14.703
Good night.

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:34.014
Good night. Sweet dreams.
